<title>DENMARK: SOCCER-DENMARK BEAT BOSNIA IN UNDER-21 QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-DENMARK BEAT BOSNIA IN UNDER-21 QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>KOEGE, Denmark 1997-06-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Denmark beat Bosnia 5-0</p>
<p>(halftime 4-0) in a European under-21 championship group one</p>
<p>qualifying match on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers: Thomas Gravesen 12, 29, Alex Noerlund 23, Peter</p>
<p>Grauland 43, Peter Madsen 77.</p>
<p>Attendance: 1,468.</p>
<p>    Standings	 P  W  D  L  F  A   Pts</p>
<p> Greece		 6  4  1  1  7  3   13</p>
<p> Denmark		5  3  0  2 11  6    9</p>
<p> Croatia		5  2  0  3  5  6    6</p>
<p> Slovenia	     5  2  0  3  5  7    6</p>
<p> Bosnia		 5  1  1  3  3  9    4</p>
<p>Next match: August 19 Bosnia v Denmark.</p>
</text>
